<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-WORLD TEAM CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WORLD TEAM CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>DUESSELDORF, Germany 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of World Team Cup matches played on Thursday:</p>
<p>Blue Group</p>
<p>Spain lead Germany 1-0</p>
<p>Results (Spanish names first): Albert Costa beat Michael Stich 6-1 6-3</p>
<p>Sweden lead Netherlands 1-0</p>
<p>Results (Swedish names first): Magnus Larsson beat Paul Haarhuis 2-6 6-3 6-2</p>
</text>
